// P3G.3 (essential-tips.md T1.3, X1; external-references.md ER7.2, ER7.3, ER7.7;
// intro-to-drawings.md D2.10, X1): moving tabs to another document, from a drawing tab's menu and
// from the Tab manager. "Exercise: Move to Document" (`move-doc setup`) with "Drawing 1", a Front
// view of the Pneumatic Piston (`move-doc drawing`); "Plates library", a document with V1
// (`move-doc plates`).
// 01 (D2.10) right-click the Drawing 1 tab → "Move to document…" hovered.
// 02 (ER7.3) the dialog, Show details: Drawing 1 (picked) and Pneumatic Piston (referenced).
// 03 Pneumatic Piston unticked (left here): the note that the drawing will reference it at a
//    new version of this document; name "Piston drawings"; "Moving 1 tab to Piston drawings".
// 04 moved: Drawing 1 is gone here; the toast names V1 of this document, made for the tab left
//    here.
// 05 Piston drawings opened: Drawing 1, the Sheets pane: its reference "Pneumatic Piston" at V1
//    with the version icon (a link back to the exercise document).
// 06 (ER7.7) back in the exercise document: the Tab manager (the tab bar's leftmost icon) lists
//    the tabs.
// 07 Topplate clicked, Baseplate Ctrl+clicked: both selected; "Move 2 tabs to document…" hovered.
// 08 (ER7.2) the dialog's Other documents: the locations.
// 09 My documents → the documents; Plates library hovered.
// 10 Plates library picked: its 1 version, "Version name" V2, "2 tabs will be moved", "Moving
//    2 tabs to Plates library".
// 11 moved: Hexapod, Pneumatic Piston, Piston Assembly left; the Hexapod's Baseplate and
//    Topplate rows show the version icon (Plates library V2).
// 12 Plates library opened: Part Studio 1, Assembly 1, Topplate, Baseplate; its History panel
//    shows V2 "Moved from Exercise: Move to Document: Topplate, Baseplate".
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("move-doc setup"),
        Wait(90),
        Custom("move-doc plates"),
        Wait(10),
        Custom("move-doc drawing"),
        Wait(60),
        RightClick(ui("tab-drawing-1")),
        WaitFor("tab-context-menu"),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("tab-move")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("01-drawing-tab-move"),
        Click(ui("tab-move")),
        WaitFor("move-to-document-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("move-details")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-drawing-details"),
        Click(ui("move-tab-2")),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("move-name")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("Piston drawings"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-left-behind"),
        Click(ui("move-confirm")),
        Wait(90),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-drawing-moved"),
        Custom("move-doc open Piston drawings"),
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(60),
        Click(ui("drawing-sheets-toggle")),
        Wait(30),
        Hover(ui("sheet-ref-1-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("05-link-back"),
        Custom("move-doc open Exercise: Move to Document"),
        Wait(60),
        Click(ui("tab-hexapod")),
        Wait(30),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        Click(ui("tab-manager")),
        WaitFor("tab-manager-panel"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-tab-manager"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-row-4")),
        Wait(10),
        KeyDown("Ctrl"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-row-5")),
        KeyUp("Ctrl"),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("tab-manager-move")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("07-two-tabs-selected"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-move")),
        WaitFor("move-to-document-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("move-tabs-1")),
        WaitFor("move-other-loc-mine"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-other-documents"),
        Click(ui("move-other-loc-mine")),
        WaitFor("move-other-doc-plates-library"),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("move-other-doc-plates-library")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("09-plates-library"),
        Click(ui("move-other-doc-plates-library")),
        WaitFor("move-target"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-target-and-version"),
        Click(ui("move-confirm")),
        Wait(90),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11-plates-moved"),
        Custom("move-doc open Plates library"),
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(60),
        Click(ui("rail-history")),
        WaitFor("history-panel"),
        Wait(20),
        Hover(ui("history-version-2")),
